  "scope": "Absolute isolated planPatrol timing on fully charted authored Huge/Legendary post-capture states.128owned zero-movement guard companies receive real setPatrol and queueMovement commands between two six-hex-separated owned hearths, then canonical authored route pauses. Foreign ownership and observer relocation are explicitly authored before strict save validation; this is not a played conquest or an organically earned empire. Every world cell is explored to expose the one-pass visibility-index cost, but current sight remains restricted to actual sources: an explored hidden foreign town is absent from the permitted settlement roster. Dedicated own scouts reveal distant foreign stacks at one distinct cell per foreign faction. Visible foreign, hidden foreign and still-owned endpoints isolate cleanup while zero movement prevents existing recovery queries in the own control. One warmup and three fresh-observation samples unless --verify-only. Excludes setup, observations, serialization/hashing, assertions, command execution/replay, whole AI/turns, campaign pacing, worker transfer and rendering. No speedup, network, tail-latency or gameplay timing claim.",
